{"type": "message", "id": "me0e02014", "parentId": "mccc0b54e", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T04:20:56Z", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A RESTful API is an architectural style for designing web services that uses standard HTTP methods to manipulate resources identified by URLs, typically exchanging data in formats like JSON while remaining stateless and scalable."}], "stopReason": "stop", "usage": null}}
{"type": "message", "id": "m6a36595e", "parentId": "me0e02014", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T04:20:56Z", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "写一首关于夏天的四行短诗。"}]}}
{"type": "message", "id": "m5da6026d", "parentId": "m6a36595e", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T04:21:18Z", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**RESTful API的一句话解释**：它是一种基于HTTP协议的架构风格，通过标准方法（如GET、POST、PUT、DELETE）对“资源”进行操作，通常以JSON格式交换数据，且系统设计为无状态的，以保证可扩展性和互操作性。  \n\n**关于夏天的四行短诗**：\n```\n碧空如洗太阳高，\n暖风轻抚夏虫鸣。\n池塘戏水涟漪起，\n夜凉风起且徜徉。"}], "stopReason": "stop", "usage": null}}
